/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/sabra-health-care-reit-inc-sbra-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"SBRA 2019 Q3","e":"sbra","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick Matros","x":"So we're finishing the restructuring, we're focusing on the balance sheet, so we're not focusing on acquisitions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/sabra-health-care-reit-inc-sbra-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"SBRA 2019 Q3","e":"sbra","d":"2019-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Nick Joseph","x":"You reaffirmed guidance and previously, you've indicated that you're trending toward the low-end of the range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/sabra-health-care-reit-inc-sbra-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"SBRA 2019 Q4","e":"sbra","d":"2020-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick Matros","x":"One of the things that our operators are still working through that will have a big impact on the improved coverage is the cost reduction therapy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/24/sabra-health-care-reit-inc-sbra-q4-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"SBRA 2019 Q4","e":"sbra","d":"2020-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick Matros","x":"No, we're not restructuring leases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/24/sabra-health-care-reit-inc-sbra-q4-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"SBRA 2020 Q1","e":"sbra","d":"2020-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rick Matros","x":"I don't really have a good answer, but I think that the question you pose is one of the reasons that when the 6.2% FMAP increase happened, we actually saw a relatively small number of states pass that on is they should have to the providers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/sabra-health-care-reit-inc-sbra-q1-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"SBRA 2020 Q1","e":"sbra","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick Matros","x":"So that said, the cost savings that we saw prior to the pandemic from PDPM have pretty much gone away because much of those cost savings had to do with group and concurrent therapy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/sabra-health-care-reit-inc-sbra-q1-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"SBRA 2020 Q1","e":"sbra","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick Matros","x":"So those cost savings will come back post the pandemic currently do not exist.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/sabra-health-care-reit-inc-sbra-q1-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"SBRA 2020 Q4","e":"sbra","d":"2021-02-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rick Matros","x":"So the paradigm doesn't change and we expect to see things normalize more as everything else normalizes and we moved pass through the pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/sabra-health-care-reit-inc-sbra-q4-2020-earnings-c/"},{"c":"SBRA 2021 Q2","e":"sbra","d":"2021-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick Matros","x":"And the other final point I would make is, when we exited 2018, we had finished all the restructuring early in 2019 that was related to CCP, along with the sales of Genesis as well and Senior Care Centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/sabra-health-care-reit-inc-sbra-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"SBRA 2021 Q2","e":"sbra","d":"2021-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick Matros","x":"We're not going to be taking on larger deals that require restructuring or any of the cleanup that will prolong sort of the noise around the company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/sabra-health-care-reit-inc-sbra-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"SBRA 2021 Q3","e":"sbra","d":"2021-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Talya Nevo-Hacohen","x":"So you've got occupancy and you've got rates for on the revenue line, and the rate is where operators are really th